<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Shohoj Hishab</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1f2937;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 50%, #047857 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 
                0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25),
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            padding: 40px 40px 60px;
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header-banner::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -20px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 40px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }
        
        .success-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .success-icon svg {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .brand-name {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        
        .brand-tagline {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        
        .content-section {
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .welcome-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5 0%, #a7f3d0 100%);
            color: #065f46;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .celebration-emoji {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .description {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .features-grid {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .features-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #374151;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        
        .feature-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 100%);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .feature-icon svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .feature-text {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .feature-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #111827;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .feature-desc {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .button-wrapper {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 
                0 10px 15px -3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3),
                0 4px 6px -2px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 
                0 20px 25px -5px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35),
                0 10px 10px -5px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
        }
        
        .offer-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .offer-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .offer-title {
            color: #92400e;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        
        .offer-text {
            color: #b45309;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .footer-section {
            background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .footer-brand {
            color: #10b981;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .footer-address {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        
        .footer-contact {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding-top: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        
        .footer-contact a {
            color: #f97316;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        @media only screen and (max-width: 540px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            
            .header-banner {
                padding: 32px 24px 50px;
            }
            
            .content-section {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }
            
            .footer-section {
                padding: 24px;
            }
            
            .greeting {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="header-banner">
                <div class="success-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M9 12L11 14L15 10M21 12C21 16.9706 16.9706 21 12 21C7.02944 21 3 16.9706 3 12C3 7.02944 7.02944 3 12 3C16.9706 3 21 7.02944 21 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="brand-name">Shohoj Hishab</div>
                <div class="brand-tagline">সহজ হিসাব | Smart POS System</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="welcome-badge">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                    </svg>
                    Email Verified Successfully!
                </div>
                
                <div class="celebration-emoji">🎉</div>
                
                <h1 class="greeting">Welcome Aboard, {{displayName}}!</h1>
                
                <p class="description">
                    Congratulations! Your email has been verified. You're now part of 
                    <strong>Shohoj Hishab</strong> - Bangladesh's smartest POS system!
                </p>
                
                <div class="features-grid">
                    <div class="features-title">What You Can Do</div>
                    
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <div class="feature-title">Create Digital Invoices</div>
                            <div class="feature-desc">Generate professional invoices in just 3 clicks</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <div class="feature-title">Smart Inventory</div>
                            <div class="feature-desc">Real-time stock tracking with low-stock alerts</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <div class="feature-title">Track Credit & Due</div>
                            <div class="feature-desc">Manage customer credits with automatic reminders</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <div class="feature-title">Analytics Dashboard</div>
                            <div class="feature-desc">Real-time sales reports and profit tracking</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="button-wrapper">
                    <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="cta-button">
                        Go to Dashboard
                    </a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="offer-banner">
                    <div class="offer-icon">🎁</div>
                    <div class="offer-title">Special Launch Offer</div>
                    <div class="offer-text">Try Pro plan FREE for 7 days! No credit card required.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="footer-section">
                <p class="footer-text">
                    © 2026 <span class="footer-brand">Shohoj Hishab</span>. All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p class="footer-address">Banani, Dhaka-1213, Bangladesh</p>
                <div class="footer-contact">
                    <a href="mailto:support@shohojhishab.com">Need help? Contact Support</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
